  "ingredients": [
    "1 cup butter, softened",
    "0.75 cup white sugar",
    "1 egg, beaten",
    "3 cups all-purpose flour",
    "0.25 teaspoon salt",
    "0.5 cup crushed peppermint candy canes",
    "0.75 cup confectioners' sugar",
    "5 teaspoons warm water",
    "2 tablespoons crushed peppermint candy canes, or to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Lightly grease baking sheets, or line with parchment paper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat butter and sugar together in a large bowl with an electric mixer until light and fluffy. Beat in egg until completely incorporated.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nS07Hxf7kzuhxfgc1IqfM9DBi1s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235104-peppermint-holiday-cookies-VAT-step-02-d6cd89750355430791dcb4be23301f3b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235104/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix in flour and salt to form a soft dough. Fold in crushed candy canes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZtZK5_9TLPVdn0QJOzOCfqqrE74=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235104-peppermint-holiday-cookies-VAT-step-03-176e5350526f4b7daf2c688db50accdd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235104/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll dough into walnut-size balls and place 1 inch apart onto prepared baking sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/gdPSgTIrYSWKbZ4Qo6IkV2lvr9w=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235104-peppermint-holiday-cookies-VAT-step-04-06bc374a97ef4ba39e5cbc2cedc9363a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235104/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until edges are golden, 8 to 10 minutes. Cool on the baking sheet briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely, 8 to 10 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/_4XDzV0MnU2ix4xXHDBf3TMzelE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235104-peppermint-holiday-cookies-VAT-step-05-1587d80337ba46be92e48a5b342d52ab.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235104/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, make the icing: Whisk confectioners' sugar and warm water together in a small bowl until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uqXhiJqX0Pg1Bz6VxfEMSSqDPdA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235104-peppermint-holiday-cookies-VAT-step-06-a65b5d10c88c488cbedcf24fc53c48bb.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235104/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip the top of a cookie into icing, then sprinkle with crushed candy canes. Repeat with remaining cookies. Allow icing to set before serving, at least 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ft4FakivqUGrU79oBz6y42uQu_Q=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/235104-peppermint-holiday-cookies-VAT-step-07-526eafa47d684d5b9cbcfce62e7303b5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/235104/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
